{"PMT":{"id":"dcd02fb5-3c05-4351-aa6d-43a004bd94bf","word":"PMT","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"premenstrual tension","tags":["feminine"],"word":"TPM"}],"pos":"noun","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"Other circumstances, such as sunburn, travel, or emotional crisis, can also aggravate fluid retention and \"PMT\".","ref":"1978, Barbara Seaman, Gideon Seaman, Women and the crisis in sex hormones:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[107,110]],"id":"7d690253-c8c7-49ba-a8b0-c92255136605"},{"text":"Fraser knew girls had periods but he'd never heard of PMT.","ref":"2006, Mike Edwards, Friendly Fire:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[54,57]],"id":"d291c2b6-4685-4c52-925e-807d9307fffa"},{"text":"In the 20th century Frank coined the term premenstrual tension (PMT).","ref":"2006, Peter Clark, Ian A Greer, Practical Obstetric Hematology:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[64,67]],"id":"c5806f0f-ef3d-4680-8495-66c5243ed468"},{"text":"\"It's PMT - she'll be back.\" \"I expect that's your father - let's eat.\"","ref":"2006, Rachel Loosmore, Saucy Shorts for Chefs:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[6,9]],"id":"d6ad23fa-9d4a-4509-927b-2707452022ae"}],"topics":["medicine","sciences"],"categories":["British English","English initialisms","English terms with quotations","English uncountable nouns","Quotation templates to be cleaned","en:Medicine"],"links":[["medicine","medicine"],["premenstrual tension","premenstrual tension#English"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"PMS"}],"raw_glosses":["(uncountable, medicine, now chiefly UK) Initialism of premenstrual tension."],"glosses":["Initialism of premenstrual tension."],"tags":["UK","abbreviation","alt-of","initialism","uncountable"],"alt_of":[{"word":"premenstrual tension"}],"id":"0ddd4e62-1461-400c-999c-c41a9a68b5ce"},{"topics":["business","electrical-engineering","electricity","electromagnetism","electronics","energy","engineering","natural-sciences","physical-sciences","physics"],"categories":["English abbreviations","English countable nouns","en:Electronics"],"links":[["electronics","electronics"],["photomultiplier tube","photomultiplier tube#English"]],"raw_glosses":["(countable, electronics) Abbreviation of photomultiplier tube."],"glosses":["Abbreviation of photomultiplier tube."],"tags":["abbreviation","alt-of","countable"],"alt_of":[{"word":"photomultiplier tube"}],"id":"83f888a2-40c5-4c87-a60f-7cfc30174da1"}],"related":[],"synonyms":[]}}
